# Main Branch Workflow

- Always work on the `main` branch for this repo unless the user explicitly asks for a feature branch.
- Before starting work, ensure you are on `main` and up to date (`git checkout main && git pull origin main`).
- Commit and push directly to `origin/main` — do not create or use feature branches unless explicitly requested.
- Do not open pull requests unless the user asks for one.
